Another issue is taxes. according to the Ethical Consumer website Amazon has been critised for not paying enough tax. Open sources saying that Amozon may have not avoided around 575 mollion in UK corporation tax in 2024. I think this is not how it should be because smaller buisnesses,do not have the same oportunities but still have to follow the ruls and pay their tax correctly.

In my opinion big companies like an Amazon have to be more attentive and responsible with their actions to make sure that everybody feel the same.

